<title>SWITZERLAND: Saurer posts 1996 profit of 51 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Saurer posts 1996 profit of 51 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>ARBON, Switzerland 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>					(million Swiss Francs)</p>
<p> Group net			  51 profit     vs  75 loss</p>
